{
  "id": "724",
  "title": "Look at Flowers",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-05-09",
  "synopsis": "Do you want to go look at flowers?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1038/05f005d1139d7609bdefb7143b8a1fdca573a750.mp3?1556788579",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "看花\n\n本：春天来了！\n小雨：是啊！对了，明天我和丽丽去看花，你和我们一起去吗？\n本：看花？\n小雨：春天来了，公园的花开了，很漂亮。我们去看花。\n本：好！我也去。明天几点？\n小雨：10点。\n本：好的。明天见。",
    "traditional": "看花\n\n本：春天來了！\n小雨：是啊！對了，明天我和麗麗去看花，你和我們一起去嗎？\n本：看花？\n小雨：春天來了，公園的花開了，很漂亮。我們去看花。\n本：好！我也去。明天幾點？\n小雨：10點。\n本：好的。明天見。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Look at Flowers"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：春天来了！",
      "traditional": "本：春天來了！",
      "pinyin": "běn chūn tiān lái le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Spring has arrived!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小雨：是啊！对了，明天我和丽丽去看花，",
      "traditional": "小雨：是啊！對了，明天我和麗麗去看花，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ shì a duì le míng tiān wǒ hé lì lì qù kàn huā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "你和我们一起去吗？",
      "traditional": "你和我們一起去嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ hé wǒ men yì qǐ qù ma",
      "english": "Little Yu: It sure has! Oh, that’s right, Lili and I are going to look at flowers tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Are you going together with us?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "本：看花？",
      "traditional": "本：看花？",
      "pinyin": "běn kàn huā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: To look at flowers?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小雨：春天来了，公园的花开了，很漂亮。",
      "traditional": "小雨：春天來了，公園的花開了，很漂亮。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ chūn tiān lái le gōng yuán de huā kāi le hěn piào liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "我们去看花。",
      "traditional": "我們去看花。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men qù kàn huā",
      "english": "Little Yu: Spring has arrived, the flowers in the park are blooming, it’s very beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "We are going to look at the flowers."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：好！我也去。明天几点？",
      "traditional": "本：好！我也去。明天幾點？",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo wǒ yě qù míng tiān jǐ diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok! I am coming too. At what time tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小雨：10点。",
      "traditional": "小雨：10點。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ 1 diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: 10 o’clock."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：好的。明天见。",
      "traditional": "本：好的。明天見。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de míng tiān jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Alright. See you tomorrow."
    }
  ],
